      "content": "it's not just about feelings though. it's like... every time i struggle or can't make ends meet, it's another thing they have to deal with. they're growing up watching me drown and it's just stealing their childhood. i feel like i'm sucking the life out of them just by being here. like they'd actually have a better chance at a real, happy life if they didn't have to carry me.",
